url: "https://projectnavi.ai"
abstract: >-
  The Creative Determinant (CD) framework models autopoietic closure as a
  nonlinear elliptic boundary value problem on a compact Riemannian manifold.
  Fifteen theorems are machine-verified in Lean 4 against the Mathlib library
  with zero sorry axioms. The framework bridges mathematical rigor (elliptic
  PDEs, fixed-point theorems), philosophical depth (enactivist and semiotic
  foundations), and empirical testability (the CD condition with explicit
  falsifiability criteria).
